WEBVTT

01:38.210 --> 01:41.020
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.060 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 1]

01:52.030 --> 01:52.509
Hurry.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.229
It's raining so heavily.

01:54.229 --> 01:54.680
Yes.

02:08.470 --> 02:09.120
Nan,

02:09.400 --> 02:10.400
it's raining outside.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.080
Don't run around.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.040
Got it.

02:13.310 --> 02:13.800
Ladies,

02:13.920 --> 02:14.870
please come in.

02:15.910 --> 02:16.430
This way.

02:17.480 --> 02:17.950
Welcome.

02:21.120 --> 02:22.710
Two bowls of hot noodles.

02:26.270 --> 02:27.540
That guy is really something.

02:27.910 --> 02:28.980
He's been eating all afternoon.

02:29.390 --> 02:30.280
How long has he starved for?

02:31.150 --> 02:34.460
[Jiu Xuanye]

02:31.590 --> 02:32.470
Please enjoy.

02:32.560 --> 02:33.630
Okay, thank you.

02:33.630 --> 02:34.750
We've been sitting here all afternoon,

02:34.960 --> 02:36.150
watching him eat.

02:36.400 --> 02:37.520
We're not much better.

02:38.240 --> 02:38.960
You're right.

02:40.660 --> 02:42.020
The rain is about to stop.

03:06.710 --> 03:08.680
This way, please.

03:31.210 --> 03:36.090
♫There is grass in the wild♫

03:37.610 --> 03:43.110
♫Dewdrops sparkle atop♫

03:44.000 --> 03:47.030
♫There is a beauty♫

03:47.150 --> 03:49.970
♫Clear and beautiful♫

03:49.150 --> 03:49.870
Nan?

03:50.310 --> 03:51.550
♫I meet her by coincidence♫

03:51.400 --> 03:52.070
Nan!

03:51.579 --> 03:55.920
♫My wish is fulfilled♫

03:53.000 --> 03:53.710
Nan!

03:56.350 --> 04:00.970
♫There is grass in the wild♫

04:46.550 --> 04:48.280
Sir, you're amazing!

04:55.310 --> 04:55.950
Sound eel.

05:03.100 --> 05:05.250
Someone died!

05:06.190 --> 05:07.480
Oh no, I fell for the trap.

05:08.680 --> 05:09.680
This person died.

05:10.390 --> 05:12.040
Thank you.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.040
This...

05:17.040 --> 05:18.000
How come he went in?

05:18.020 --> 05:18.550
Who is he?

05:34.510 --> 05:34.920
The officials!

05:35.120 --> 05:35.680
The officials are here.

05:49.270 --> 05:49.800
My lord.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.430
It's that throat-slitter again.

05:55.240 --> 05:56.040
Did anyone see

05:56.040 --> 05:57.040
what the scoundrel looked like?

05:58.120 --> 05:59.310
-No.
-No.

05:59.310 --> 06:00.680
-Didn't see.
-Didn't see.

05:59.590 --> 06:02.790
[Duan Yanqiu, County Commandant of Nanyang City]

06:04.800 --> 06:05.480
Be gentle.

06:06.750 --> 06:07.390
Come here, you two.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.240
Come, take this box

06:10.260 --> 06:11.040
to Master's room.

06:10.410 --> 06:13.570
[Duan Residence, Nanyang City]

06:11.270 --> 06:11.950
Come.
Yes.

06:12.160 --> 06:12.560
Hurry.

06:14.000 --> 06:15.270
How were you all

06:15.720 --> 06:17.120
in Yuanzhou?

06:17.450 --> 06:20.140
[Duan Banxia]

06:19.720 --> 06:20.390
I was well.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.240
I just missed Grandmother.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.950
I missed you too.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.560
I kept wishing

06:27.000 --> 06:29.430
you could come back as soon as possible.

06:29.630 --> 06:30.270
Yes.

06:31.190 --> 06:31.800
Banxia,

06:32.600 --> 06:34.510
have you recovered from your sickness?

06:35.800 --> 06:36.600
I'm much better.

06:36.920 --> 06:37.680
Then,

06:37.210 --> 06:40.400
[Duan Tian, Duan Banxia's Aunt]

06:37.870 --> 06:39.360
can you still see

06:39.600 --> 06:41.000
those strange things?

06:41.030 --> 06:42.700
[Duan Yingheng, Duan Banxia's Father]

06:43.920 --> 06:46.390
I don't see them anymore after taking the medicine.

06:48.510 --> 06:49.560
That's good.

06:50.560 --> 06:52.430
That means the physician is capable.

06:52.750 --> 06:54.920
The medicine is also effective.

06:57.130 --> 06:58.840
Take the medicine carefully.

06:59.150 --> 07:01.510
[Duan Tao, Duan Banxia's Grandmother]

06:59.390 --> 07:01.800
Don't let your father worry about you.

07:02.720 --> 07:03.870
Grandmother is right.

07:04.270 --> 07:05.510
I will keep it in mind.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.480
Where is Yanqiu?

07:09.070 --> 07:09.720
How come

07:10.400 --> 07:11.370
I don't see Yanqiu?

07:13.800 --> 07:14.390
He’s been busy

07:15.430 --> 07:16.750
with government matters recently.

07:17.070 --> 07:18.270
He was called there early in the morning.

07:17.180 --> 07:20.600
[Duan Heming, Duan Banxia's Uncle]

07:19.510 --> 07:20.070
But

07:20.500 --> 07:22.230
he knows you arrive today,

07:22.430 --> 07:23.680
so he will come back early.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.830
His marriage is soon.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.830
Can't he take a rest?

07:30.350 --> 07:31.240
Recently,

07:31.330 --> 07:32.180
the city has a few

07:32.360 --> 07:33.270
tricky murder cases.

07:33.680 --> 07:35.270
A murderer who slits throats

07:35.430 --> 07:37.830
fled from Guangping to Nanyang,

07:38.680 --> 07:40.090
causing panic among the people.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.450
The higher-ups urged him to solve the case as soon as possible.

07:43.060 --> 07:44.659
They won't allow him to take leave.

07:44.830 --> 07:45.560
Speaking of which,

07:46.430 --> 07:47.510
how come Yanqiu's marriage

07:47.720 --> 07:48.750
was set so hurriedly?

07:49.390 --> 07:50.680
I didn't even hear

07:50.800 --> 07:51.840
which family you've decided on.

07:52.830 --> 07:54.190
Who is it?

07:54.250 --> 07:56.180
Does Yanqiu love her?

07:59.380 --> 08:00.450
Uncle Yingheng, you came so fast.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.560
I went to pick you up at the city gate,

08:01.630 --> 08:02.360
but I was too slow.

08:02.590 --> 08:03.420
Yanqiu is back.

08:03.750 --> 08:04.360
Grandmother.

08:05.240 --> 08:05.870
Uncle Yingheng.

08:06.560 --> 08:07.400
Returning now

08:07.510 --> 08:08.560
won't affect your work, right?

08:08.820 --> 08:09.450
Don't worry.

08:09.480 --> 08:10.630
I've taken care of everything.

08:11.830 --> 08:12.430
Okay.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.310
Greetings, Yanqiu.

08:16.850 --> 08:18.480
Uncle Yingheng wrote in the letter

08:18.560 --> 08:19.800
that your illness has improved a lot.

08:21.910 --> 08:22.430
Yes.

08:23.850 --> 08:25.000
Thanks to you,

08:25.190 --> 08:26.900
the medicine that the physician prescribed works well.

08:27.270 --> 08:28.390
I recovered after a few doses.

08:29.150 --> 08:29.860
That's good.

08:30.710 --> 08:31.190
Demons don't exist

08:31.190 --> 08:32.179
in the world.

08:32.350 --> 08:33.539
Don't think too much nonsense in the future.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.539
Treat your illness if you're ill.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.350
You'll only recover faster

08:35.419 --> 08:36.150
if the medicine is correct.

08:38.350 --> 08:39.419
You're right.

08:52.940 --> 08:53.580
My lady,

08:54.540 --> 08:55.420
what are you doing?

08:56.750 --> 08:58.150
Father's pouch is old.

08:58.540 --> 08:59.820
I'm making him a new one.

09:00.820 --> 09:01.510
My lady,

09:02.820 --> 09:04.040
with your embroidery skills,

09:04.060 --> 09:05.350
you should just buy Master a new one.

09:13.110 --> 09:13.780
My lady,

09:14.300 --> 09:16.110
I just heard a secret.

09:16.350 --> 09:17.350
Do you want to know?

09:19.900 --> 09:21.580
If I don't let you tell me,

09:21.900 --> 09:23.090
you'll suffocate to death.

09:23.630 --> 09:24.350
Tell me.

09:25.480 --> 09:27.170
I heard from Xiang in the kitchen

09:27.630 --> 09:29.110
the Elder Master didn't agree to

09:29.140 --> 09:30.500
Young Master's marriage.

09:30.820 --> 09:31.520
Young Master

09:31.540 --> 09:32.620
made a scene

09:32.940 --> 09:34.060
and scared Elder Madam.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.790
That's how they got engaged.

09:36.270 --> 09:36.940
My lady,

09:37.940 --> 09:38.700
why do you think

09:38.700 --> 09:40.030
Young Master is so bold?

09:40.390 --> 09:41.540
He can marry anyone.

09:41.660 --> 09:43.930
[Tingzhou, Duan Banxia's Maid]

09:42.030 --> 09:43.750
Why does he insist on a performer?

09:48.150 --> 09:49.230
My lady, what do you think?

09:49.630 --> 09:51.580
If a performer marries into our family,

09:52.540 --> 09:55.620
she'll be like a pheasant turning into a phoenix

09:56.060 --> 09:57.420
and completely transform her status.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.110
My lady?

10:05.270 --> 10:06.110
What's wrong?

10:15.110 --> 10:15.700
My lady,

10:16.900 --> 10:18.430
did you see something again?

10:28.060 --> 10:28.660
My lady.

10:31.780 --> 10:32.390
No.

10:33.940 --> 10:35.420
We should mind our own business.

10:37.660 --> 10:38.150
Got it.

10:45.700 --> 10:46.270
Excuse me,

10:46.870 --> 10:47.550
two bowls of tea.

10:47.780 --> 10:48.420
Okay.

10:48.630 --> 10:49.390
More food.

10:49.870 --> 10:50.780
Please come in.

10:52.180 --> 10:52.870
Have a seat.

10:55.720 --> 10:58.900
[Chi Xue]

11:15.580 --> 11:16.150
How is it?

11:16.700 --> 11:17.940
Any news of the Human-faced Owl?

11:19.670 --> 11:20.270
Yes.

11:20.580 --> 11:21.420
It's in the Duan family,

11:22.510 --> 11:23.940
in the west alley of Yongning Fang

11:23.940 --> 11:25.270
of Nanyang City.

11:25.630 --> 11:26.180
They're rich.

11:26.180 --> 11:26.900
You'll find it when you get there.

11:28.180 --> 11:28.660
Okay.

11:28.900 --> 11:29.700
I'll go there first.

11:30.820 --> 11:31.870
Help me take care of the one

11:31.940 --> 11:32.510
behind me.

11:33.300 --> 11:34.030
Behind you?

11:36.350 --> 11:37.470
Youhuang is following you again?

11:38.630 --> 11:39.630
He's haunting me like a ghost.

11:44.820 --> 11:45.900
It's raining. My lady, hurry!

11:48.900 --> 11:50.110
I'll get an umbrella.

12:02.470 --> 12:03.030
Father.

12:04.900 --> 12:05.630
You're back.

12:19.420 --> 12:20.270
I'm going back to my room.

12:20.900 --> 12:22.300
Father, where did you go just now?

12:23.860 --> 12:24.860
I was handling some matters.

12:25.420 --> 12:27.030
You've been going out a lot lately.

12:27.180 --> 12:28.540
Did something happen?

12:29.300 --> 12:30.180
Nothing important.

12:30.900 --> 12:31.330
We haven't

12:31.350 --> 12:32.350
been back in a long time.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.760
I need to take care of

12:34.150 --> 12:35.510
many people and things.

12:36.990 --> 12:38.820
Grandmother asked about my marriage.

12:43.870 --> 12:44.390
Banxia,

12:45.570 --> 12:46.210
I know

12:46.780 --> 12:48.060
you are not satisfied with this marriage.

12:49.510 --> 12:50.750
But a girl must get married

12:50.830 --> 12:51.870
when she grows up.

12:52.700 --> 12:53.630
I'm familiar

12:53.940 --> 12:54.750
with Li Xian.

12:55.150 --> 12:56.870
He is indeed a gentle and polite person.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.280
You can rely on him.

12:59.510 --> 13:00.420
If you marry him,

13:01.060 --> 13:02.150
you won't be mistreated.

13:02.780 --> 13:03.660
Your mother

13:05.180 --> 13:06.990
should be the one helping you with these matters.

13:08.180 --> 13:08.900
What a pity.

13:12.350 --> 13:13.180
Our family

13:13.470 --> 13:14.350
has saved up some wealth.

13:14.580 --> 13:15.270
In the future,

13:15.330 --> 13:16.480
it will be your dowry.

13:17.160 --> 13:17.800
Your cousin

13:17.820 --> 13:18.630
is an official.

13:19.150 --> 13:19.630
No one

13:20.150 --> 13:21.350
can bully you.

13:37.230 --> 13:37.820
Father,

13:38.090 --> 13:38.920
I embroidered

13:38.940 --> 13:40.270
a new pouch for you.

13:46.460 --> 13:48.530
My daughter's embroidery is not bad.

13:49.510 --> 13:50.470
Not bad?

13:51.300 --> 13:52.540
Even Tingzhou said

13:52.870 --> 13:54.350
I should just buy you a new one.

13:55.660 --> 13:56.510
That's different.

13:58.770 --> 14:00.590
[Duan Residence]

14:10.700 --> 14:12.230
Sprinkle grains and beans

14:12.630 --> 14:14.180
to avoid the three evils.

14:14.750 --> 14:17.320
First handful for a beautiful home.

14:14.820 --> 14:16.650
[Weide Hall]

14:17.700 --> 14:20.300
Second for a prosperous family.

14:21.090 --> 14:23.880
Third for happiness and harmony.

14:25.270 --> 14:27.060
Look into the mirror and bow.

14:27.320 --> 14:29.280
Unite as a couple.

14:30.300 --> 14:32.470
Evil spirits shall be exorcised forever.

14:36.210 --> 14:37.290
Bow once.

14:39.540 --> 14:40.870
Bow twice.

14:44.150 --> 14:45.420
Bow thrice.

14:52.580 --> 14:53.540
My lady, hurry up.

14:53.660 --> 14:55.270
You won't see the bride if you're late.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.940
I told you

14:56.940 --> 14:57.660
Master went over long ago.

14:57.660 --> 14:58.750
You didn't believe me.

15:00.030 --> 15:01.390
I'm already walking quickly.

15:02.060 --> 15:02.580
Hurry.

15:04.750 --> 15:05.580
Congratulations.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.030
Congratulations.

15:10.060 --> 15:11.270
Congratulations.

15:11.300 --> 15:12.030
Thank you.

15:12.270 --> 15:13.060
Thank you.

15:13.150 --> 15:14.350
Congratulations.

15:15.630 --> 15:16.660
Come on, Li.

15:16.660 --> 15:17.700
Drink more today.

15:18.150 --> 15:19.060
It's my wedding day.

15:19.060 --> 15:19.780
You must drink more.

15:19.810 --> 15:21.050
Come on. This way.

15:59.630 --> 16:00.350
What's wrong?

16:35.350 --> 16:35.940
My lady.

16:37.470 --> 16:38.110
Tingzhou,

16:39.420 --> 16:40.900
don't you think

16:41.520 --> 16:44.800
the new sister-in-law...

16:48.180 --> 16:48.900
What?

16:52.940 --> 16:54.580
Could she be...

16:55.630 --> 16:56.350
My lady,

16:57.740 --> 16:59.060
did you see something again?

16:59.580 --> 17:00.580
Are you sick again?

17:00.990 --> 17:01.510
The fragrance.

17:01.900 --> 17:03.310
Yes, the calming fragrance.

17:06.260 --> 17:07.060
I didn't see it.

17:07.380 --> 17:08.619
I didn't see anything.

17:10.099 --> 17:11.030
You scared me.

17:11.579 --> 17:13.060
I thought you were sick again.

17:13.990 --> 17:15.270
The auspicious hour is coming.

17:15.710 --> 17:16.819
Ladies and gentlemen,

17:16.950 --> 17:17.750
please be seated.

17:17.750 --> 17:18.470
My lady,

17:19.579 --> 17:20.950
I think the banquet is starting in the front yard.

17:21.619 --> 17:22.780
Let's go to the banquet.

17:23.380 --> 17:24.339
You go first.

17:25.619 --> 17:26.470
What about you?

17:29.430 --> 17:30.380
I'll wait for Father.

17:31.990 --> 17:33.510
I'll go with him when he comes.

17:34.780 --> 17:35.510
Okay.

17:55.030 --> 17:55.820
Are you drunk?

17:55.910 --> 17:57.580
I'm not drunk.

17:58.030 --> 17:59.710
This way, right? This way.

17:59.780 --> 18:00.860
Over there.

18:01.230 --> 18:01.860
No, no.

18:03.670 --> 18:04.540
This way.

18:05.510 --> 18:06.270
Over here!

18:07.270 --> 18:08.030
Honey!

18:08.510 --> 18:09.510
I'm here.

18:09.990 --> 18:11.340
Duan.

18:11.510 --> 18:12.540
Here, here.

18:15.910 --> 18:16.580
Duan,

18:17.230 --> 18:19.300
every moment of the night is precious.

18:19.380 --> 18:19.910
Duan,

18:20.030 --> 18:22.100
we'll see you off here.

18:22.780 --> 18:23.380
Thank you.

18:24.100 --> 18:24.860
See you another day.

18:25.620 --> 18:26.510
See you.

18:27.140 --> 18:28.060
Let's go.

18:50.430 --> 18:51.270
My bride,

18:51.990 --> 18:52.820
nice to meet you.

19:18.430 --> 19:19.620
Who are you?

19:20.540 --> 19:21.580
You actually came

19:21.850 --> 19:22.470
to my bedroom

19:22.470 --> 19:23.580
in the middle of the night.

19:23.910 --> 19:24.580
Manniang,

19:25.160 --> 19:25.990
you're being naughty again.

19:42.760 --> 19:44.470
You scoundrel! How dare you?

19:45.190 --> 19:45.750
Miss,

19:46.050 --> 19:46.770
let's run.

19:46.880 --> 19:48.160
Where are you running to?

19:48.820 --> 19:49.820
There are no doors or windows here.

19:50.780 --> 19:52.100
I really have nowhere to run to.

19:53.340 --> 19:55.140
But Young Master,

19:55.580 --> 19:57.380
I'm already married to someone.

19:58.330 --> 19:59.220
Can you

19:59.620 --> 20:00.510
please...

20:01.950 --> 20:02.860
let me go?

20:03.830 --> 20:04.500
I can't.

20:06.140 --> 20:08.270
I'm in love with your looks.

20:08.730 --> 20:10.490
Why don't you discuss it

20:10.510 --> 20:11.580
with your fiance

20:12.270 --> 20:13.550
to cancel this marriage

20:14.270 --> 20:15.780
and marry me instead?

20:19.950 --> 20:21.110
My husband

20:22.420 --> 20:23.660
is skilled in martial arts,

20:23.720 --> 20:24.720
archery, and equestrianism.

20:25.060 --> 20:26.380
Aren't you afraid he'll fight you

20:26.760 --> 20:27.840
if he finds out?

20:37.430 --> 20:38.140
What a coincidence.

20:39.110 --> 20:41.520
I'm also good at archery and equestrianism,

20:41.540 --> 20:42.380
and skilled in martial arts.

20:43.620 --> 20:44.750
Just tell him.

20:45.300 --> 20:46.300
If he comes,

20:47.780 --> 20:49.620
I can compete with him.

20:55.430 --> 20:57.750
What can I do now that I am

20:58.540 --> 21:00.060
in your hands?

21:05.190 --> 21:06.300
I can only surrender.

21:14.010 --> 21:14.700
Unfortunately,

21:15.430 --> 21:17.230
no one will hear

21:17.900 --> 21:19.330
my ventriloquist skills again.

21:20.340 --> 21:21.140
Yes.

21:22.190 --> 21:23.310
Only I, your husband,

21:23.340 --> 21:24.300
can hear it now.

22:00.340 --> 22:01.230
Be careful!

22:02.900 --> 22:03.770
Are you hurt?

22:12.300 --> 22:13.030
Who are you?

22:13.920 --> 22:15.510
Your wife is a demon.

22:15.860 --> 22:16.750
I'm here to kill demons.

22:17.070 --> 22:17.790
How dare you!

22:35.520 --> 22:36.410
Hurry!

22:38.270 --> 22:38.840
Obey orders!

22:38.860 --> 22:39.540
-Don't move!
-Don't move!

22:41.600 --> 22:42.190
He's the one.

22:54.660 --> 22:55.310
Arrest him!

23:13.510 --> 23:14.580
If the demon isn't killed,

23:14.710 --> 23:15.910
your family will have no peace.

23:20.910 --> 23:21.540
Go after him!

23:21.780 --> 23:22.510
-Yes.
-Yes.

23:28.580 --> 23:29.380
I've asked.

23:29.780 --> 23:30.620
No one knows.

23:32.510 --> 23:33.030
I see.

23:33.230 --> 23:33.780
You may leave.

23:34.230 --> 23:34.780
Yes.

23:37.670 --> 23:38.670
Everyone is dismissed.

23:39.190 --> 23:39.780
Yes.

23:40.190 --> 23:41.300
Did you see how

23:42.160 --> 23:43.080
that thief got in when you were outside

23:43.100 --> 23:43.990
last night?

23:44.620 --> 23:46.230
It was dark last night.

23:46.720 --> 23:48.160
I was too afraid.

23:48.340 --> 23:49.580
I saw nothing.

23:58.580 --> 23:59.430
Yanqiu,

24:01.670 --> 24:03.910
that man said Sister-in-law is a demon.

24:04.060 --> 24:04.780
Nonsense!

24:05.620 --> 24:06.750
He was spouting nonsense,

24:06.780 --> 24:07.430
but now,

24:07.670 --> 24:08.860
you're adding to the trouble too.

24:09.950 --> 24:11.270
Did you forget to take your medicine?

24:15.340 --> 24:16.540
I'm not the one who said it.

24:28.340 --> 24:29.300
Recently,

24:29.430 --> 24:30.620
there have been many murders in the city.

24:31.670 --> 24:32.990
I'm searching for the murderer.

24:33.380 --> 24:35.140
Maybe the thief is the mastermind.

24:36.230 --> 24:37.510
He must have received some news,

24:37.780 --> 24:39.030
so he came to provoke us.

24:41.140 --> 24:42.190
But don't be afraid.

24:42.760 --> 24:43.780
I've dispatched men

24:43.800 --> 24:44.430
from the government

24:44.580 --> 24:45.310
to guard our home.

24:45.580 --> 24:46.910
No matter how skilled he is,

24:47.270 --> 24:48.140
he won't be able to break in.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.620
You didn't sleep well

24:54.300 --> 24:55.300
due to the commotion last night.

24:55.820 --> 24:56.620
Go back and rest.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.230
Okay.

25:03.510 --> 25:04.270
Wait.

25:07.660 --> 25:09.760
The banquet was in the front yard last night.

25:09.780 --> 25:10.710
Why were you in my courtyard,

25:11.330 --> 25:12.490
instead of eating?

25:15.890 --> 25:17.690
I was late for the ceremony.

25:18.140 --> 25:19.510
I couldn't see my sister-in-law clearly,

25:20.270 --> 25:22.060
so I wanted to visit her.

25:24.060 --> 25:26.340
Your sister-in-law was frightened last night.

25:26.750 --> 25:27.780
Don't disturb her now.

25:28.300 --> 25:29.670
You'll have opportunities to meet in the future.

25:30.100 --> 25:30.820
Yes.

25:59.950 --> 26:00.860
This is a flying fish.

26:01.270 --> 26:02.300
It's gentle

26:02.580 --> 26:03.540
and can be seen everywhere,

26:04.390 --> 26:05.540
but its spiritual power is weak.

26:05.990 --> 26:06.780
In order to survive,

26:07.140 --> 26:08.860
it must hide its form at all times.

26:09.820 --> 26:11.230
Ordinary people can't see it,

26:11.860 --> 26:13.030
but you can,

26:13.380 --> 26:14.070
right?

26:20.710 --> 26:21.680
I can't see.

26:24.190 --> 26:25.740
Then why are you running?

26:40.030 --> 26:41.060
Clearly, you can see it,

26:41.270 --> 26:42.900
but you lie to yourself that you can't.

26:43.690 --> 26:44.320
Do you think you can escape

26:44.340 --> 26:45.230
just by avoiding it?

26:46.170 --> 26:47.370
That's all fake.

26:48.750 --> 26:50.230
You know clearly if it's fake or not.

26:55.320 --> 26:55.950
I know

26:56.670 --> 26:57.750
you're scared,

26:58.620 --> 26:59.340
but don't worry.

26:59.910 --> 27:00.990
I'm a demon hunter.

27:01.380 --> 27:02.300
As long as I'm here,

27:02.510 --> 27:03.820
no demon can hurt you.

27:04.250 --> 27:05.640
Just bravely tell your family

27:05.720 --> 27:07.110
what you saw.

27:11.910 --> 27:12.750
Understand?

27:16.990 --> 27:17.540
Fine.

27:18.060 --> 27:19.910
Go to your cousin now

27:20.060 --> 27:21.540
and tell him the whole story.

27:21.750 --> 27:22.670
Lead him here to see me.

27:29.330 --> 27:29.910
By the way...

27:32.100 --> 27:33.540
If you're able to,

27:33.790 --> 27:34.440
can you

27:34.460 --> 27:35.370
bring me some food?

27:36.470 --> 27:39.710
Like cakes, warm noodles,

27:39.960 --> 27:41.790
and steamed buns. Anything is fine.

27:55.340 --> 27:55.990
Thank you.

28:01.910 --> 28:02.910
Help!

28:03.780 --> 28:04.620
Help!

28:05.620 --> 28:06.540
Help!

28:06.860 --> 28:08.510
The thief is here!

28:09.510 --> 28:09.990
My lady,

28:10.140 --> 28:10.950
what's wrong?

28:11.190 --> 28:11.860
Hurry.

28:12.230 --> 28:13.340
The thief from last night

28:13.340 --> 28:13.990
is in my room.

28:14.380 --> 28:15.240
Hurry!

28:15.270 --> 28:15.950
Go!

28:29.100 --> 28:30.270
What happened?

28:31.670 --> 28:32.670
Where did he go?

28:36.140 --> 28:36.620
Ms. Duan,

28:36.820 --> 28:37.950
when Physician Sun comes back,

28:38.070 --> 28:39.200
I will notify you.

28:41.290 --> 28:42.660
Don't you still have the calming fragrance?

28:42.880 --> 28:44.030
You can sniff it

28:44.090 --> 28:44.870
when your illness returns.

28:44.950 --> 28:45.950
I guarantee your vision will be clear

28:46.050 --> 28:46.810
and your heart will be calm.

28:47.910 --> 28:48.430
Take care.

28:48.620 --> 28:49.540
Thank you.

29:01.620 --> 29:06.860
Great!

29:15.470 --> 29:16.430
Stop running.

29:16.990 --> 29:18.470
I just want to make things clear.

29:18.710 --> 29:19.540
I won't hurt you.

29:20.580 --> 29:21.300
You...

29:24.620 --> 29:25.710
Just listen to him.

29:27.140 --> 29:27.910
Don't be afraid.

29:32.190 --> 29:32.910
Why did she run away?

29:33.030 --> 29:34.030
Who told you to come here?

29:34.540 --> 29:35.470
I came to help you.

29:40.300 --> 29:41.020
Second Lady.

29:41.230 --> 29:41.860
Second Lady.

29:43.300 --> 29:44.780
What's wrong with Second Lady?

29:44.980 --> 29:45.770
I don't know.

29:59.350 --> 29:59.980
My lady.

30:01.620 --> 30:02.230
My lady.

30:03.030 --> 30:03.950
Young Master sent a box

30:03.980 --> 30:05.330
of desserts from Liupinju over.

30:05.540 --> 30:06.380
They're still warm.

30:09.860 --> 30:10.860
What's wrong?

30:10.860 --> 30:12.100
You don’t look well.

30:23.230 --> 30:25.190
Young Master is so nice to you.

30:26.100 --> 30:26.910
He still remembers

30:26.910 --> 30:28.340
you like the desserts here.

30:32.180 --> 30:32.830
Tingzhou?

30:34.960 --> 30:36.440
Have you heard of

30:36.860 --> 30:38.580
how my brother and sister-in-law

30:38.910 --> 30:40.030
met each other?

30:40.430 --> 30:41.670
Of course.

30:42.600 --> 30:43.450
I wouldn't dare to tell you

30:43.470 --> 30:44.540
if you didn't ask me.

30:45.750 --> 30:47.160
Xiang told me

30:47.430 --> 30:48.540
three months ago,

30:48.750 --> 30:49.780
a ventriloquist

30:49.800 --> 30:51.280
came to the city.

30:52.190 --> 30:53.470
She was very talented.

30:53.950 --> 30:55.230
It is said that

30:55.750 --> 30:57.840
she could imitate anyone,

30:57.860 --> 30:59.140
no matter the age, gender, or species.

30:59.820 --> 31:02.100
She had delicate lips and voice.

31:02.950 --> 31:03.710
If you listened with your eyes closed,

31:03.710 --> 31:04.860
it would sound so real.

31:08.340 --> 31:09.140
Bravo!

31:09.470 --> 31:10.270
Lord Duan.

31:11.340 --> 31:12.140
Lord Duan.

31:13.300 --> 31:14.060
Great! Great!

31:14.060 --> 31:14.670
Awesome!

31:14.670 --> 31:15.430
Bravo.

31:15.620 --> 31:16.380
Listen.

31:17.510 --> 31:18.750
This is really enjoyable.

31:23.380 --> 31:24.620
Young Master also went to listen.

31:25.300 --> 31:26.190
He ended up

31:26.910 --> 31:28.430
becoming mesmerized.

31:28.710 --> 31:29.580
Great!

31:29.580 --> 31:31.580
I'll take you to the market today.

31:31.990 --> 31:34.470
Grandpa, I want to buy something delicious and fun.

31:36.100 --> 31:36.950
The market

31:36.950 --> 31:38.100
has everything.

31:38.380 --> 31:39.910
If you see anything fun,

31:40.030 --> 31:41.300
I'll buy it all for you.

31:41.970 --> 31:43.130
Sounds so alike.

31:44.140 --> 31:46.580
Great!

31:46.750 --> 31:51.820
[Flowery Snow]

31:52.030 --> 31:52.540
She's here.

31:52.620 --> 31:53.710
She's so pretty.

31:53.710 --> 31:55.230
That's right. It's a woman.

32:09.670 --> 32:10.620
Tell me.

32:11.000 --> 32:11.540
How could

32:11.540 --> 32:12.580
the household agree

32:13.540 --> 32:15.270
to him marrying a performer

32:15.270 --> 32:16.340
who hasn't even been on a proper stage?

32:16.710 --> 32:18.230
It's such a joke!

32:19.190 --> 32:20.340
But Young Master didn’t listen.

32:21.430 --> 32:22.230
He even said

32:23.030 --> 32:24.510
he would only marry her.

32:26.580 --> 32:27.470
In the end,

32:27.470 --> 32:28.430
he made a big fuss at home.

32:28.990 --> 32:30.470
You know what happened later.

32:30.790 --> 32:32.790
Young Master is an official now.

32:33.410 --> 32:34.690
The Elder Master can’t control him

32:35.030 --> 32:36.620
and Elder Madam dotes on him.

32:36.910 --> 32:38.380
He can do whatever he wants,

32:39.430 --> 32:40.780
He finally succeeded in the end.

32:41.710 --> 32:44.030
I wonder what happened

32:44.060 --> 32:45.060
on the wedding night.

32:46.470 --> 32:47.430
Anyway,

32:47.910 --> 32:49.060
Young Master said

32:50.750 --> 32:52.580
the new madam was frightened.

32:52.790 --> 32:54.370
Now, she can't even leave her room.

32:55.140 --> 32:56.300
She hasn't even greeted

32:56.300 --> 32:56.990
the two madams yet.

32:57.340 --> 32:58.780
She hasn't served the bride's tea either.

32:59.340 --> 33:00.950
How can everyone be happy with this?

33:02.380 --> 33:03.190
Actually,

33:03.720 --> 33:05.330
everyone can see that

33:05.520 --> 33:07.080
the new madam is not a simple person,

33:07.470 --> 33:08.100
but Young Master

33:08.100 --> 33:09.330
protects her

33:09.360 --> 33:10.340
like he's lost his mind.

33:11.300 --> 33:12.670
I wonder what kind of spell he's under.

33:24.780 --> 33:26.030
Second Lady, please wait a moment.

33:59.760 --> 34:01.320
Greetings, Sister-in-law.

34:02.270 --> 34:03.250
We are family now.

34:03.270 --> 34:04.580
No need to be so courteous.

34:07.990 --> 34:09.219
Are you here to see me?

34:10.469 --> 34:11.500
A thief broke into our home

34:11.530 --> 34:12.860
and scared you.

34:13.219 --> 34:14.699
I came to see how you are doing.

34:15.620 --> 34:16.659
Thank you.

34:17.409 --> 34:18.239
I'm okay.

34:18.260 --> 34:19.429
I'll be fine after a few days of rest.

34:23.179 --> 34:24.139
Don't be shy.

34:24.610 --> 34:25.610
Let's sit and talk.

34:29.350 --> 34:31.179
I haven't been out for the past few days,

34:31.580 --> 34:33.540
so I didn't prepare any snacks at home.

34:34.179 --> 34:35.870
I only have some flower cakes from Liupinju.

34:36.739 --> 34:38.150
I hope you don't mind.

34:39.350 --> 34:40.540
Sister-in-law, no need.

34:40.870 --> 34:42.270
Please sit down and rest.

34:46.219 --> 34:47.870
I have a headache these days.

34:48.870 --> 34:50.310
I couldn't visit Grandmother

34:50.989 --> 34:52.350
as according to customs.

34:55.139 --> 34:56.659
You are not feeling well.

34:57.100 --> 34:57.870
I don't think

34:58.060 --> 34:59.660
Grandmother would blame you.

35:02.870 --> 35:04.140
Since I came to this household,

35:04.790 --> 35:05.700
only you

35:05.700 --> 35:06.540
came to see me.

35:12.960 --> 35:14.280
Unlike you,

35:15.320 --> 35:16.760
I don't have a father or brother to protect me.

35:17.620 --> 35:18.870
I grew up wandering around the world,

35:18.900 --> 35:19.860
performing for a living.

35:22.140 --> 35:23.790
Luckily, I met Qiu.

35:25.220 --> 35:26.950
He didn't mind my lowly background

35:27.620 --> 35:29.510
and insisted on marrying me as his wife.

35:30.220 --> 35:31.740
You might laugh at me,

35:32.390 --> 35:33.430
but even now,

35:33.940 --> 35:34.910
I still can't believe

35:34.910 --> 35:35.950
that all of this is real.

35:38.100 --> 35:38.990
When I wake up,

35:39.020 --> 35:40.540
I forget where I am.

35:41.740 --> 35:42.740
It's like a dream.

35:55.190 --> 35:57.070
I know everyone dislikes me

35:59.990 --> 36:01.830
and think I've bewitched Qiu.

36:03.870 --> 36:04.950
I won't deny it.

36:06.580 --> 36:07.950
I couldn't dissuade him

36:08.870 --> 36:10.430
or my heart

36:12.030 --> 36:13.140
and became greedy.

36:14.150 --> 36:15.960
That's why there are conflicts in your family.

36:20.700 --> 36:21.540
But Banxia...

36:23.700 --> 36:25.100
I truly like him.

36:25.130 --> 36:26.860
I want to be with him forever.

36:30.260 --> 36:31.220
Do you believe me?

36:34.470 --> 36:35.310
Yes.

36:36.580 --> 36:37.540
I do.

36:42.830 --> 36:43.950
You're so nice.

36:46.060 --> 36:47.180
In this house,

36:47.470 --> 36:48.790
you're the best person to me,

36:48.790 --> 36:50.030
other than Qiu.

36:51.870 --> 36:53.540
That day at the main hall,

36:53.830 --> 36:54.680
I only glanced at you

36:54.700 --> 36:55.700
through the veil,

36:56.080 --> 36:57.010
and I thought you were

36:57.030 --> 36:58.350
someone I could have heart-to-heart talks with.

37:01.350 --> 37:02.180
Unfortunately,

37:03.470 --> 37:04.510
you're only

37:04.510 --> 37:05.220
staying here temporarily.

37:07.700 --> 37:08.580
Otherwise,

37:08.580 --> 37:10.030
we can be together forever.

37:17.180 --> 37:18.700
You're so beautiful.

37:21.620 --> 37:23.140
Your skin is so fair

37:24.740 --> 37:26.030
and you have a nice voice.

37:28.910 --> 37:30.870
I heard that you're already engaged to someone.

37:32.400 --> 37:33.620
I wonder which family

37:33.620 --> 37:34.990
is so lucky to have you.

37:40.350 --> 37:41.100
Sister-in-law,

37:42.060 --> 37:43.540
I suddenly feel

37:43.870 --> 37:45.430
I might have caught a cold.

37:45.850 --> 37:47.370
I want to go back and rest.

37:49.660 --> 37:51.030
It's rare for you to visit.

38:00.030 --> 38:00.540
Sister-in-law,

38:00.540 --> 38:01.660
I'm going back to rest.

38:09.480 --> 38:11.970
Amazing.

38:13.020 --> 38:13.750
Wow.

38:15.580 --> 38:16.870
Awesome!

38:17.000 --> 38:19.890
Bravo! Bravo!

39:07.130 --> 39:08.260
Rabbit guy!

39:14.430 --> 39:15.470
Rabbit guy!

39:21.580 --> 39:22.740
Rabbit guy!

39:24.580 --> 39:25.420
Are you looking for me?

39:31.280 --> 39:32.680
Who exactly are you?

39:36.990 --> 39:38.910
Didn't I tell you before?

39:40.060 --> 39:41.310
I'm just a demon hunter.

39:44.980 --> 39:46.910
Do demons really exist?

39:49.430 --> 39:50.470
Since you're looking for me,

39:51.220 --> 39:52.260
you must have made up your mind.

39:56.620 --> 39:58.660
Demons are the spirits created from the world

39:59.310 --> 40:00.510
and born from the void.

40:00.870 --> 40:02.180
They exist between illusion and reality.

40:02.790 --> 40:03.660
They can be hazy

40:04.030 --> 40:05.060
or have a tangible shape.

40:05.550 --> 40:06.220
The largest ones

40:06.300 --> 40:07.630
can hover in the universe,

40:07.740 --> 40:08.620
swallowing stars and moon.

40:09.310 --> 40:10.080
The smallest ones

40:10.140 --> 40:11.350
are like stones and pebbles,

40:11.790 --> 40:12.620
nameless.

40:13.540 --> 40:14.990
Humans and demons are from two worlds,

40:15.580 --> 40:16.350
but

40:16.700 --> 40:17.790
we can coexist.

40:18.660 --> 40:19.790
However, some demons

40:19.950 --> 40:20.830
are delusional

40:21.040 --> 40:22.290
and want to intervene in the human world.

40:22.790 --> 40:23.580
Other demons

40:23.910 --> 40:25.620
would sacrifice their cultivation

40:25.830 --> 40:26.790
just to harm people.

40:27.430 --> 40:28.140
This kind of demon

40:28.470 --> 40:29.260
must be eliminated.

40:32.470 --> 40:33.790
What about my eyes?

40:35.540 --> 40:36.260
Most demons

40:36.560 --> 40:37.660
are proficient in

40:37.680 --> 40:39.490
disguise and invisibility.

40:40.620 --> 40:42.430
As long as they don't show up voluntarily,

40:42.700 --> 40:44.390
ordinary people can't see them.

40:44.990 --> 40:45.740
But not only can you

40:45.770 --> 40:46.700
see through their disguise,

40:47.030 --> 40:47.700
you can even

40:47.730 --> 40:48.850
see through their invisibility.

40:49.660 --> 40:50.180
This talent

40:50.180 --> 40:51.470
is one in a million.

40:52.180 --> 40:54.470
What? You don't like it?

41:08.510 --> 41:09.430
Calming fragrance?

41:11.000 --> 41:11.970
It's harmful.

41:16.580 --> 41:17.220
This thing

41:17.350 --> 41:18.580
can temporarily

41:18.580 --> 41:19.350
cover your divine consciousness

41:19.580 --> 41:20.790
so you're unable to see those things.

41:21.540 --> 41:23.030
However, smelling it too much is bad for your brain.

41:24.700 --> 41:25.990
Is what you just said

41:26.540 --> 41:27.540
all true?

41:29.260 --> 41:30.030
If you didn't believe me,

41:30.140 --> 41:31.270
you wouldn't have come to me.

41:31.870 --> 41:33.510
I believe there are demons in the world.

41:33.740 --> 41:34.870
But how do I know

41:34.950 --> 41:36.740
if you really are a demon hunter?

42:29.790 --> 42:30.910
You came to Nanyang City

42:31.000 --> 42:31.600
to attend

42:31.620 --> 42:32.870
your brother's wedding?

42:35.660 --> 42:36.220
What a coincidence.

42:36.780 --> 42:37.780
There is a wedding

42:37.830 --> 42:39.140
in this place today.

42:40.230 --> 42:40.670
Look.

42:41.060 --> 42:41.740
They're here.

42:46.660 --> 42:47.470
Who's here?

42:55.390 --> 42:56.470
You used the calming fragrance?

43:01.440 --> 43:02.180
That thing

43:02.180 --> 43:03.510
will only weaken your five senses

43:03.990 --> 43:04.680
and ruin

43:04.700 --> 43:05.660
your rare vision.

43:07.030 --> 43:07.540
How about this?

43:08.140 --> 43:08.990
This is a rare opportunity.

43:09.580 --> 43:10.470
I’ll use hypostasis water

43:10.790 --> 43:11.740
to help you see again.

43:17.760 --> 43:18.920
No thanks.

43:21.440 --> 43:22.030
I...

43:22.620 --> 43:23.390
It will sting.

43:23.870 --> 43:24.620
Hang in there.

43:30.150 --> 43:31.190
What is this?

43:37.790 --> 43:38.740
Now take a look

43:39.120 --> 43:39.920
and see if you can see it.

43:51.660 --> 43:52.310
It's okay.

43:52.810 --> 43:53.600
Don't be scared.
